  "notes": [
    "Nintendo Japan accessory spec modal for the Nintendo Switch AC adapter; the EU information leaflet (HAC-002(EUR)) and Nintendo's EU ecodesign page print the same ratings. Axis map: width=65.8 (幅), height=50.8 (高さ), depth=34.6 (厚さ); 'excluding the AC plug and DC cable' is recorded as excludes_projections=true.",
    "Two output rails: output_voltage_v / output_current_a hold the higher rail (15.0 V / 2.6 A, the one that powers the dock) and output_rails holds both as printed (Nintendo's footnote: the voltage changes automatically with the connected device). output_connector: the cable is hardwired and plugs into the console's USB Type-C port (Nintendo's console page), hence the standard-part key usb-c-plug.",
    "prong_standard and inlet: not stated (the AC plug folds into the body on the JP unit, not printed); null. Regional variants (JPN/USA/EUR/UKV/AUS) share the model number with a suffix; the dimension and rating figures here are the Japanese page's."
